1 file(s) differ beyond 0.011

Explained difference: 01_outlook_next_30_days.csv is the live outlook. The DuckDB run fetched
the live forecast at 04:00 UTC, the Postgres runs later the same evening; in between, Open-Meteo
published a new GFS run (best_match and gfs_seamless changed by up to 1.0 C for 15-21 Nov, ecmwf
and gem did not; compared row by row from both stored raw_live_forecast tables). Every table
computed from history (error by lead, both evaluations, leaderboards, data quality) is identical.
The column band_p10_p90_c was renamed start_band_c after the review; values are unchanged.
